### 1. Valid GET → 200
GET http://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/skiers/1/seasons/2019/days/1/skiers/123

### 2. Missing parameters
GET http://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/skiers/

### 3. Invalid structure → 400
GET http://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/skiers/1/invalid/2019

### 4. Valid POST → 201
POST http://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/skiers/1/seasons/2019/days/1/skiers/123
Content-Type: application/json

{"time": 217, "liftID": 21}

### 5. Invalid JSON type → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/skiers/1/seasons/2019/days/1/skiers/123
Content-Type: application/json

{"time": "invalid", "liftID": 21}

### 6. Empty body → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/skiers/1/seasons/2019/days/1/skiers/123
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. [Assignment] liftID out of range → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/skiers/1/seasons/2019/days/1/skiers/123
Content-Type: application/json

{"time": 217, "liftID": 41}

### 8. [Assignment] time out of range → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/skiers/1/seasons/2019/days/1/skiers/123
Content-Type: application/json

{"time": 0, "liftID": 21}

### 9. [Assignment] negative ID in URL → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/skiers/-1/seasons/2019/days/1/skiers/123
Content-Type: application/json

{"time": 217, "liftID": 21}

### 10. Health check -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/health

### 11. WebSocket leaderboard subscription
WEBSOCKET ws://localhost:8080/ski-servlet/leaderboard/7